    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the Market this fine 3-bedroom detached bungalow, with numerous Sheds ideally situated in the heart of Castlebar. This spacious and well-maintained home offers an exceptional opportunity for anyone seeking a quality residence just a short stroll from Town amenities including Shops, i.e. Supervalu /Penney’s, Schools, Bars & Restaurants. The property comprises spacious bright Entrance Hall, a bright and welcoming Living Room with a marble fireplace, a fully fitted Kitchen /Dining area, with pellet stove and back boiler integral hot-press. Bathroom with electric shower over the bath fully tiled, storage press .3 Bedrooms the home benefits from pellet stove central heating, and double-glazed hardwood windows throughout, ensuring comfort and energy efficiency.\r\nOutside, there is a private driveway with ample off-street parking, and gardens offering privacy & space for outdoor enjoyment. The property also benefits from a detached sheds nestled in a quiet and established residential area. This property would make an ideal family Home, Retirement Residence, or Investment Opportunity. Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this fine home has to offer.\r\nFor further details or to arrange a viewing, contact Moran Auctioneers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The Accommodation comprises:-\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: (3`3”x 13`8”x 30`4”) With tiled area and oak flooring.\r\nLounge: (11`8”x 11`7”) With marble fireplace and oak flooring.\r\nKitchen/ Dining Area: (15`5”x 10`3”) With full range of oak units ( No Appliances) and Pellett Stove central heating. Tiled floor with integral Hot -press.\r\nUtility: (3`5”x 7`5”) With part tiled walls and tiled floor. Tiled floor. Storage Cupboard and Clothes Closet.\r\nBedroom(1):(11`3”x 10`5”) With oak flooring.\r\nBathroom:(4`8”x 10`7”) With white suite , tiled walls and floor. Electric shower over bath.\r\nBedroom(2): (12`1”x 9`9”) With oak flooring.\r\nBedroom(3): (13`4”x 8`2”) With oak flooring.\r\nPellett Stove Heating.\r\n\r\nShed(1): (13`2”x 8`9”)\r\n\r\nShed(2): (8`6”x 13`7”)\r\n\r\nShed(3):(9`3”x 15`2”)\r\n\r\n• Concrete Rear Yard front and drive.\r\n• Lawn to front.\r\n• Attic insulated.\r\n• Outside Tap.\r\n• Constructed 1979.\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      }
